#: fedoraglass/gui/backend.py:3210
msgid "Steam and its games, video players (VLC, mpv, Videos, Celluloid, Clapper), RetroArch, Firefox, Brave, Discord, Slack, Zoom, Visual Studio Code, Obsidian, LibreOffice and Prism Launcher, and a few more. They draw their own solid windows, so glass behind them would only cost speed."
msgstr "Steam e i suoi giochi, lettori video (VLC, mpv, Video, Celluloid, Clapper), RetroArch, Firefox, Brave, Discord, Slack, Zoom, Visual Studio Code, Obsidian, LibreOffice e Prism Launcher, e qualche altro. Disegnano finestre piene tutte loro, quindi il vetro dietro costerebbe solo prestazioni."

